 "remarks": "Nestled on a gorgeous, professionally manicured acre in desirable West Norwalk, this lovely 4-bedroom, 2.5-bathroom Colonial offers the perfect blend of elegance and modern efficiency. The main level boasts a fantastic open floor plan, featuring a gourmet eat-in-kitchen with granite countertops and stainless steel appliances. Entertain in the formal dining room or relax in the spacious sunken living room, which flows seamlessly into a sun-filled great room. Sliding glass doors lead out to a beautiful patio and an inviting in-ground gunite swimming pool, creating a true private oasis. Upstairs, you will find four freshly painted bedrooms highlighting gleaming hardwood floors. Exceptional modern upgrades include central air conditioning, an attached two-car garage, a full-house gas-powered generator, and highly efficient solar panels that result in nearly non-existent electric bills. A spectacular home in a prime location!",
